      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"story\" feels so exhausting though. if the end result is just total disorder and silence, then all this feeling and effort is just... wasted energy. it's like building a sandcastle right before a massive tide comes in. why bother with the struggle if the outcome is predetermined to be zero? it just seems more efficient to just let the entropy take over now instead of dragging it out.",
