      "content": "i don't know if \"meaning\" is worth this much pain. it feels like you're romanticizing suffering. if we're just temporary patterns in a system that's destined to fail, isn't there a certain kind of logic in just stepping out of the cycle early? like, if the goal is inevitable stillness, wouldn't choosing that stillness yourself be more rational than waiting for the universe to force it on you?",
